{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34675942",
      "title": "One Action - Multiple Forms",
      "lectureOrder": 75,
      "videoOrder": 69,
      "sourceHash": "997af10090d7040b42bd1e59948ee96282748f3464ac438f449dd43c01636005",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.133,
          "end": 5.333,
          "en": "- [Maximillian] So we got one action here in $id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.333,
          "end": 8.5,
          "en": "but we got two forms that can trigger that action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.5,
          "end": 13.5,
          "en": "The expense form, of course, for updating an expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.6,
          "end": 17.533,
          "en": "And this expense list item where we have this delete form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.533,
          "end": 21.733,
          "en": "And even though it's not a form where we enter data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.733,
          "end": 24.533,
          "en": "it's still a form because it's not a get request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.533,
          "end": 25.5,
          "en": "which we wanna send.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 28.733,
          "en": "So using a link would be kind of wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.733,
          "end": 31.033,
          "en": "So we have two forms that trigger the same action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.033,
          "end": 33.633,
          "en": "but of course we don't wanna execute the same code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.633,
          "end": 38.533,
          "en": "We wanna execute different code for deleting and updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.533,
          "end": 41.3,
          "en": "Now it's quite easy to differentiate though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.3,
          "end": 43.733,
          "en": "We could include some query parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.733,
          "end": 45.466,
          "en": "which we then check on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.466,
          "end": 48.5,
          "en": "For example, set this to mode equals delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.5,
          "end": 51.133,
          "en": "and then on the backend, see whether we have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.133,
          "end": 52.566,
          "en": "delete as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.566,
          "end": 54.533,
          "en": "on this query parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.533,
          "end": 57.666,
          "en": "But even easier than that, we can use the method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59,
          "end": 62.2,
          "en": "This form creates a HTDP request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.2,
          "end": 64.93299999999999,
          "en": "which uses the delete HTDP method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.2,
          "end": 68.466,
          "en": "Now the expense form on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.466,
          "end": 70.43299999999999,
          "en": "uses the post method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.466,
          "end": 73.166,
          "en": "And here we could even argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.166,
          "end": 77.166,
          "en": "that for updating, post isn't even ideal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.166,
          "end": 80.1,
          "en": "We might want to set this method dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 81.9,
          "en": "on the expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.9,
          "end": 85.4,
          "en": "and simply check if we get some expense data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.4,
          "end": 87.833,
          "en": "And if we do, we know that we're updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.833,
          "end": 89.6,
          "en": "And in that case we might want to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.6,
          "end": 91.96600000000001,
          "en": "patch or put instead of post.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.96600000000001,
          "end": 96,
          "en": "And we only want to use post if we have no expense data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96,
          "end": 100.2,
          "en": "So if we are adding a new expense, then we wanna use post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.2,
          "end": 102.9,
          "en": "and patch is instead a good method to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 102.9,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "for updating because this indicates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 108.9,
          "en": "that we wanna, well patch, change a value on the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.9,
          "end": 110.8,
          "en": "which is precisely what we want to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.166,
          "end": 114.96600000000001,
          "en": "So with that change, this form sends a patch request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.96600000000001,
          "end": 116.566,
          "en": "if you wanna update.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.566,
          "end": 118.733,
          "en": "And this form in expense list item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.733,
          "end": 120.1,
          "en": "sends a delete request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.1,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "if we wanna delete an item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 124.3,
          "en": "and therefore we can use this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.3,
          "end": 129,
          "en": "HTDP method in our action in id.jsx to run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129,
          "end": 130.533,
          "en": "different code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.533,
          "end": 132.766,
          "en": "Because we get the request here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132.766,
          "end": 135.933,
          "en": "and we can not just use that to extract data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 135.933,
          "end": 138.966,
          "en": "but we can also check what the request method is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.966,
          "end": 142.066,
          "en": "If it's equal to delete, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.066,
          "end": 145.233,
          "en": "And important here, it will always be all caps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.233,
          "end": 148.766,
          "en": "and you must check for all caps, otherwise it will fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.766,
          "end": 152.266,
          "en": "So we could check if it's delete and then execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.266,
          "end": 156.933,
          "en": "one piece of code and execute different code for updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.933,
          "end": 158.133,
          "en": "And that is what I'll do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.133,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "I'll check if request method is equal to patch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 164.933,
          "en": "So if we're updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 164.933,
          "end": 168.833,
          "en": "and in that case I want to execute all that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.833,
          "end": 171.03300000000002,
          "en": "so we can move that into this if block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.333,
          "end": 174.8,
          "en": "Else I know that I'm deleting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.8,
          "end": 179.8,
          "en": "we could also check if request method is equal to delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.933,
          "end": 182.666,
          "en": "But I know that the only alternative request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.666,
          "end": 185.3,
          "en": "that can reach this action is a delete request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.3,
          "end": 186.933,
          "en": "so this is kind of redundant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.033,
          "end": 190.766,
          "en": "but still we can keep it here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.766,
          "end": 195.766,
          "en": "And if we are deleting, then I, well don't want to update.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 196.733,
          "end": 200.36599999999999,
          "en": "Instead then we wanna add a new function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.36599999999999,
          "end": 203.566,
          "en": "to this expenses.server.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.566,
          "end": 206.1,
          "en": "And here this async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.1,
          "end": 209.633,
          "en": "which I export could be named delete expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 209.633,
          "end": 211.1,
          "en": "and expects to get the idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 211.1,
          "end": 213.7,
          "en": "of the expense that should be deleted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.7,
          "end": 217.133,
          "en": "And then we can await prisma.expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.133,
          "end": 220.6,
          "en": "And then there is a delete method which we can execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.6,
          "end": 222.933,
          "en": "and we have to pass a configuration object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.933,
          "end": 226.566,
          "en": "to it where we set the wear configuration again to look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.566,
          "end": 228.7,
          "en": "for the expense where the ID is equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 228.7,
          "end": 230.466,
          "en": "to the ID we're getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 230.466,
          "end": 234.733,
          "en": "And then this will delete this entry in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 234.733,
          "end": 238.2,
          "en": "And again, we can wrap it with try catch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.2,
          "end": 240.4,
          "en": "copy that from up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.4,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "And that would therefore delete this entry",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 243.866,
          "en": "from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.166,
          "end": 248.566,
          "en": "And with that, we can call delete expense here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.566,
          "end": 252.2,
          "en": "in this delete branch of this action if check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 253.3,
          "end": 256.166,
          "en": "So here we call delete expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.166,
          "end": 258.666,
          "en": "which of course is now also imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 258.666,
          "end": 262.9,
          "en": "from the expenses.server JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 262.9,
          "end": 265.533,
          "en": "And with delete expense being called here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 265.533,
          "end": 268.5,
          "en": "we just have to pass the expense ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.5,
          "end": 270.866,
          "en": "which I'm extracting outside of the IF block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 270.866,
          "end": 273.9,
          "en": "because both if branches needed the ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 277.133,
          "en": "So I'm passing expense ID to delete expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 278.06600000000003,
          "end": 279.466,
          "en": "And then we can await this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 279.466,
          "end": 281.2,
          "en": "and then for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 281.2,
          "end": 284.733,
          "en": "all the return are redirection to /expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 284.733,
          "end": 287.33299999999997,
          "en": "though that is the page on which we already are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.33299999999997,
          "end": 288.3,
          "en": "when we click this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 288.3,
          "end": 290.6,
          "en": "We can still redirect there, but I'll get back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 290.6,
          "end": 292.83299999999997,
          "en": "to this in the next lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 293.766,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "For the moment that is it though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 295.2,
          "end": 296.733,
          "en": "This will delete an expense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 296.733,
          "end": 299.633,
          "en": "And this is one example for using one action that's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.633,
          "end": 302.933,
          "en": "triggered by multiple forms that should do different things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 302.933,
          "end": 304.2,
          "en": "We can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 304.2,
          "end": 307.1,
          "en": "use the request method as we're doing it here to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 307.1,
          "end": 310.8,
          "en": "then run different pieces of code for these different forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 311.766,
          "end": 315.966,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this and I click a second expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 315.966,
          "end": 316,
          "en": "And with that, if we save this and I click “A second expense”",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 316.1,
          "end": 318.2,
          "en": "This works, and this was deleted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 318.2,
          "end": 320.133,
          "en": "and then the loader is called again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.133,
          "end": 322.466,
          "en": "because Remix does this automatically when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 322.466,
          "end": 324.233,
          "en": "an action was performed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 324.233,
          "end": 328,
          "en": "and it then shows me the updated list of expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
